Package: zuutftest
Title: Consumer Fixture for the zuutf C Table
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not a real package and never published. It proves that
    zuutf's registered C table can be consumed from another package's C
    code: LinkingTo for the header, Imports plus a real importFrom() in
    NAMESPACE so that zuutf's namespace is loaded and the callable resolves.
    It is built and run only by consumer.yaml.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports: 
    zuutf
LinkingTo: 
    zuutf
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
